{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"7c111f07a9bd9423759abb7c8e169e1e99ed2bf1c6e109dc17b097e7eec739cf","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米利暗受罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西娶了古實女子為妻。米利暗和亞倫因他所娶的古實女子就毀謗他，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「難道耶和華單與摩西說話，不也與我們說話嗎？」這話耶和華聽見了。（"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["摩西為人極其謙和，勝過世上的眾人。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華忽然對摩西、亞倫、米利暗說：「你們三個人都出來，到會幕這裏。」他們三個人就出來了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華在雲柱中降臨，站在會幕門口，召亞倫和米利暗，二人就出來了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華說：「你們且聽我的話：你們中間若有先知，我－耶和華必在異象中向他顯現，在夢中與他說話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我的僕人摩西不是這樣；他是在我全家盡忠的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我要與他面對面說話，乃是明說，不用謎語，並且他必見我的形像。你們毀謗我的僕人摩西，為何不懼怕呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華就向他們二人發怒而去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["雲彩從會幕上挪開了，不料，米利暗長了大痲瘋，有雪那樣白。亞倫一看米利暗長了大痲瘋，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["就對摩西說：「我主啊，求你不要因我們愚昧犯罪，便將這罪加在我們身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["求你不要使她像那出母腹、肉已半爛的死胎。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["於是摩西哀求耶和華說：「上帝啊，求你醫治她！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和華對摩西說：「她父親若吐唾沫在她臉上，她豈不蒙羞七天嗎？現在要把她在營外關鎖七天，然後才可以領她進來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["於是米利暗關鎖在營外七天。百姓沒有行路，直等到把米利暗領進來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["以後百姓從哈洗錄起行，在巴蘭的曠野安營。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}